# Never commit legacy data: it holds volunteers' contact details. The component's own SQL (install, uninstall and
# the versioned updates) must be committed, or a release built from git breaks the upgrade.
*.sql
!com_ra_footpaths/administrator/sql/*.sql
!com_ra_footpaths/administrator/sql/updates/mysql/*.sql
*.csv
images/
*.zip
.DS_Store
.claude/
